  <h2>2. Description of Service</h2>
  <p>
    Belongary is a platform for anonymous, self-reported reviews of workplace belonging. The Service aggregates and displays review data to help job seekers and employees understand workplace culture through identity-specific lenses.
  </p>

  <h2>3. User Conduct</h2>
  <p>By submitting a review, you represent that:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>You are reporting your genuine experience at a company where you currently work or have previously worked.</li>
    <li>Your review complies with our <a href="/guidelines" class="text-coral hover:text-coral/80 underline">Community Guidelines</a>.</li>
    <li>You are not submitting the review as part of a coordinated campaign to manipulate scores.</li>
    <li>Any identity lens you select genuinely applies to your lived experience.</li>
